           "blockId": "ea19c2e7d4",
           "blockName": "Excerpt Para 1",
           "children": [],
           "classes": [],
           "customAttributes": {},
           "element": "p",
           "innerHTML": "The notebook on my desk has one reader, and she is not impressed. I have kept one since 2009<sup style=\"color: #3F6B4F; font-weight: 600;\">1</sup>, through four countries and two careers, and the single rule that survived is this: write the day before judging it. Every system I tried that was cleverer than that<sup style=\"color: #3F6B4F; font-weight: 600;\">2</sup> collapsed within a season.",
           "mobileStyles": {},
           "rawStyles": {},
           "tabletStyles": {}
          },
          {
           "attributes": {},
           "baseStyles": {
            "color": "var(--ba2386cf-1dc6-4b2e-8caf-102a3e808bbd, #2B2620)",
